I am looking for a warm top now.
I see a large table.
Many sweaters are lying there.
I see a thick, grey sweatshirt on the table.
I like the grey sweatshirt.
I look for my size in the stack.
I find a sweatshirt in size M.
I take the thick sweatshirt with me.
I go to the fitting room.
One cubicle is free.
I go inside and close the door.
I put the new sweatshirt on.
It is extremely comfortable, because it is very soft.
I look at the price tag.
The sweatshirt costs forty-five Euro.
That is a good price.
I take the sweatshirt off again.
I am definitely buying the comfortable sweatshirt.
